; Exercise 4: 8XY6 shifts VY on the VIP, and VX on CHIP-48. With V2 = 3
; and VB = 6, VB becomes 3 >> 1 = 1 on the VIP, and 6 >> 1 = 3 on
; CHIP-48; the digit is drawn.

6B06    ; 200  VB := 6
6203    ; 202  V2 := 3
8B26    ; 204  VB := shifted right
6305    ; 206  V3 := 5              x
640C    ; 208  V4 := 12             y
FB29    ; 20A  digit VB
D345    ; 20C
120E    ; 20E  the end
